# HHKB Professional HYBRID Type-S: the Power, Sleep and Print Screen keys do nothing.
# Its Fn layer sends Power (Fn+Esc), and logind powers the PC off at once on it;
# Sleep suspends at once; Print Screen is SysRq, and Alt+SysRq+B/O reboot or power
# off with no clean shutdown. "reserved" turns a key off. HID usages (keyboard page):
# 70066 = Power, 700f8 = Sleep, 70046 = Print Screen / SysRq.
# Installed by advanced/keyboard.sh. First line: by cable (USB ids 04fe:0021).
# Second: by name, so Bluetooth gets it too.
evdev:input:b0003v04FEp0021*
evdev:name:*HHKB*:*
 KEYBOARD_KEY_70066=reserved
 KEYBOARD_KEY_700f8=reserved
 KEYBOARD_KEY_70046=reserved
